window.SENTENCES = [{"en":"The relationship between environment and tourism has received a great amount of attention throughout the world.","cn":"环境和旅游业之间的关系已经在世界范围内引起了广泛关注。"},{"en":"In recent years, the debate about the preservation of local culture has been fuelled by overtly rapid expansion of importing.","cn":"最近几年，关于本土文化保护的争论已经被明显快速扩展的进口激化了。"},{"en":"Tourism has become an important industry, an industry that is second to none in terms of importance to our society.","cn":"旅游已经成为一个重要产业，其对社会的重要性无可比拟。"},{"en":"The rapid extension of the lifespan ，resulting from improved health and living condition, is a feature of all developed countries in the 21st century.","cn":"由于健康和生活条件的改善，人类寿命快速延长，这是二十一世纪所有发达国家的一个特征。"},{"en":"It is a highly contentious issue whether freedom of press should be restricted.","cn":"媒体自由是否应该被限制是一个被激烈争论的话题。"},{"en":"Urban sprawl has recently been thought to have negative effects on species protection.","cn":"最近人们认为，城市扩张对物种保护有负面影响。"},{"en":"It has raised public concern over the past decades that juvenile delinquency is on the rise.","cn":"在最近几十年里，青少年犯罪的不断增加已经引起了公众的关注。"},{"en":"As the century progresses, a great emphasis has been placed on women's right and their role in today's society.","cn":"随着世纪不断推移，女性权益和其在当今社会的角色已经得到更大的重视。"},{"en":"With the utilisation of smart phones becoming prevalent, its pros and cons has become a matter for debate.","cn":"随着智能手机的使用变得普遍，它的优缺点已经成为争论的话题。"},{"en":"No issue in recent years has drawn so much attention as the debate surrounding corporal punishment on children.","cn":"在这几年里，没什么话题可以像围绕针对孩子们进行体罚的争论那样吸引如此之多的关注。"},{"en":"It seems to me that the objection against Women's rights is based on incorrect facts and stereotypes.","cn":"在我看来，对妇女权利的反对意见是基于不正确的事实和偏见的。"},{"en":"I profoundly subscribe to the notion that music and sports should not be curtailed at school.","cn":"学校中的音乐和体育课程不应该被限制。对此我完全赞同。"},{"en":"It is my view that many factors should be taken into consideration when we evaluate the benefits of importing fruits and vegetables from overseas.","cn":"我认为当我们评估从海外进口蔬菜和水果的益处时,需要考虑很多因素。"},{"en":"This essay will elaborate on some factors accounting for female's underrepresentation in tertiary education.","cn":"这篇文章会具体说明一些导致女性在高等教育中比例过低的因素。"},{"en":"l am in favour of an opinion that one's characters are determined by environment rather than by heredity.","cn":"我支持人的性格是由环境而非遗传决定的这一看法。"},{"en":"l accept this proposition that disputes about whether industrialisation is a boon or a bane are fruitless.","cn":"关于工业化是好还是坏的争论是不会有结果的。我接受这一看法。"},{"en":"From my perspective, the government is more likely than companies are to reduce or avoid unethical practices in scientific research.","cn":"就我而言，政府比公司更有可能减少或避免一些在科学研究中的不道德行为。"},{"en":"I am convinced that adequate evidence cannot be found to justify the most important role genetics play in the outcome or behaviour of an individual.","cn":"我相信，没有足够的证据来证明基因在一个人的成长或行为上占有最重要的地位。"},{"en":"Notwithstanding a number of problems technological progresses would create, their overall impact may be positive.","cn":"尽管技术发展会带来很多问题，但是它的整体影响是积极的。"},{"en":"I agree with this contention that environmental protection is a","cn":"环境保护是我们保持经济持续发展所做努力的主要部分。我同意这一主张。"},{"en":"Human longevity will contribute to the forward progress of mankind.","cn":"人类的长寿有助于人类社会的进步。"},{"en":"An ageing population and a declining birth rate constitute a serious problem for the domestic employment market.","cn":"人口的老龄化和🎧生率的降低给国内就业市场带来了严重的问题。"},{"en":"Rapid population growth will put a strain on economies around the world。","cn":"人口的快速增长会在世界范围内给经济施加压力。"},{"en":"Exposure to violence shown in the media has desensitized","cn":"暴露在媒体暴力前会让观众对暴力的有害影响失去敏感性。"},{"en":"Excessive use of natural resources place human life and animals at risk。","cn":"过分使用自然资源会让人类和动物处于危险中。"},{"en":"With the trend towards lifespan extension continuing, the cost of social security and medical care is doomed to multiply.","cn":"如果人口寿命延长的趋势持续下去，那么社会保险和医疗的成本势必增力加。"},{"en":"Another benefit of studying abroad is that people can meet the locals and sample","cn":"留学的另外一个好处就是人们可以认识当地人并接触当地文化。"},{"en":"Fears of crime derive largely from the fact that crime rates are on","cn":"对犯罪的恐惧很大程度上是由于犯罪率不断上升，暴力犯罪层🎧不穷。"},{"en":"The emphasis of the government on music and art can be justified by the fact that people have valued recreation and relaxation。","cn":"人们对娱乐休闲的关注能够解释政府对音乐和艺术重视的原因。"},{"en":"One possible justification for the higher rates of unemployment among the you this that the existing education system fails to deliver employable individuals.","cn":"年轻人高失业率的一个可能的解释是，现在的教育系统不能够培养和输送有就业能力的人。"},{"en":"It is worth noting that frequent exposure to a brand during the course of an advertising campaign can enhance consumers’ memory of the brand and improve their attitudes toward this brand.","cn":"值得注意的是,在一个广告活动的过程中，重复接触一个品牌会增加消费者对这个品牌的记忆，并改善他们对这个品牌的态度。"},{"en":"Considering the fact that learners are allowed to dominate the time and place for studies, distance learning is very likely to become more popular in the years ahead.","cn":"远程教育很有可能在今后若干年里变得更加普遍，因为学习者能够控制学习的时间和地点。"},{"en":"Undoubtedly, parents can have a significant role in moderating or modifying the influence of media on children’s knowledge, attitudes, and values.","cn":"毫无疑问，父母在减少或改变媒体对孩子在知识、态度和价值观的影响方面扮演着重要的角色。"},{"en":"Designers pay more attention to functional utility of the building, assuming that it makes a building more marketable and more acceptable.","cn":"设计者更注重建筑的功能效用，他们认为这样会让建筑更加适合销售，更能被消费者接受。"},{"en":"A fact to support e-library is that by adding multimedia such as graphics, audio, and video, a library of this kind appeals to a wider range of users and makes reading more enjoyable.","cn":"建立电子图书馆基于这样一个事实，即通过增加多媒体信息，例如图像、音频和视频，这种图书馆可以吸引更大范围的用户，并给阅读带来更多的乐趣。"},{"en":"lndustrial development eventually contributes to financial improvement, which further contributes to an increase in those countries' standard of living.","cn":"工业发展最终是财政能力得以提高，而财政能力的提高又进一步使这些国家的生活标准得以提升。"},{"en":"With the presence of mandatory retirement, some employees who would like to continue working beyond age 65 are involuntarily terminated from their jobs.","cn":"强制退休规定的🎧现使一些愿意再 65 岁以后继续工作的人被迫停止他们的工作。"},{"en":"Those families less financially sound will have a greater likelihood of forming an environment that will nurture antisocial or delinquent behaviour.","cn":"这些经济条件欠佳的家庭更有可能形成一个培养反社会或犯罪行为的环境。"},{"en":"Economic restructuring and development have enhanced the income of urban residents and provided urban house construction with a solid economic foundation.","cn":"经济结构调整和发展提高了城市居民的收入,并给城市住房建设提供了坚实的经济基础。"},{"en":"Little evidence proves that ability or productivity declines with age except for occupations that rely heavily on physical strength.","cn":"很少有证据表明能力和生产力是随着年龄而减弱的，除了那些依赖体力的职业之外。"},{"en":"Media in most circumstances is of critical importance, which is the only way for the members of society to keep themselves informed","cn":"在大多数情况下，媒体是至关重要的，因为对于社会成员来说这是让他们知道身边所发生事情的唯一途径。"},{"en":"By analogy with biodiversity possibly essential to the perpetual survival of life on earth, it can be claimed that cultural diversity may be vital for the permanent survival of humanity.","cn":"用生物多样性打个比方，人们认为生物多样性对于地球上生命的长期生存是至关重要的,那么也可以说文化多样性对人类的长期生存也是至关重要的。"},{"en":"lt is the main concern that many families on low incomes are unable to afford to buy their own houses, so that subsidies are essential.","cn":"重点是很多低收入家庭负担不起购买他们自己房子的费用,因此补助是必须的。"},{"en":"Compared with high ability students usually capturing the best grades and test scores, less talented students are seldom","cn":"能力高的学生通常可以获得最好的分数和考试成绩，但才华不很🎧众的学生就很少会被老师认同，而他们所获得的成绩也不能鼓舞他们进一步努力。"},{"en":"The most important contribution of technology is making life of common people much easier and helping them achieve what was previously not possible.","cn":"科技最重要的贡献就是让普通人的生活更加方便，帮助他们达成以前不可能完成的目标。"},{"en":"By contrast, without advertising, a consumer is at the risk of purchasing product that fails to meet all of his or her needs, due to lack of knowledge of better alternatives in the market.","cn":"相对而言，如果没有广告的话，消费者因缺乏对市场上更好产品的认识，有可能购买意见不能够满足自己需要的产品。"},{"en":"Differences in social background, cultural values and religious belief might make the discrepancy of foreigners and local inhabitants","cn":"社会背景、文化价值观和宗教信仰的差异，可能使外国人与当地居民在一些问题上的分歧无法磨灭;但是,不同文化之间的互动越多，相互交流和理解的水平就越高。"},{"en":"Painting, music, movies accessible in the media have a small number of genres, imposing restraints on one’s knowledge of artworks of different cultural background.","cn":"媒体上的绘画、音乐、电影的流派较少，这限制了人们对不同文化背景的艺术作品的了解。"},{"en":"The conservation of indigenous cultures is to humankind what the conservation of species is to life.","cn":"保护本土文化至于人类就如同物种保护之于生命那样重要。"},{"en":"Their mindset has been recognised by many tourism sites and money has been subsequently directed toward cultural protection, including the maintenance of key historical sites.","cn":"他们的心态得到了许多旅游景点的认可，资金随后被用于文化保护，包括重要历史遗迹的维护。"},{"en":"In western culture, people customarily keep a certain distance from each other when having a conversation, whereas in some other cultures, the closeness of physical distance is taken as a sign of mutual trust.","cn":"在西方文化中，人们在交谈时习惯于保持一定的距离，而在其他一些文化中，身体距离的接近被视为相互信任的标志。"},{"en":"On one hand, it enables immigrants to counteract the stress that results from culture shock and to increase confidence in their residence in a new country. On the other, the flourishing of different cultures contributes to the establishment of a multi-cultural environment, a prerequisite for attracting skilled workforce from all over the world to settle.","cn":"一方面，它使移民能够抵消文化冲击造成的压力,并增强他们在新国家居住的信心。另一方面，不同文化的繁荣有助于建立多元文化环境，这是吸引世界各地熟练劳动力定居的先决条件。"},{"en":"One might argue that the rise of a global language would endanger other languages, in a belief that an increasing number of people have turned to English as their first language. This viewpoint is flawed. The spread of global English has little, if any, influence on non-English-speakers' language proficiency.","cn":"有人可能会争辩说，一种全球语言的兴起会危及其他语言，因为他们 认为越来越多的人将英语作为他们的第一语言。这种观点是有缺陷的。全球英语的传播对非英语使用者的语言能力几乎没有影响。"},{"en":"The effects of shrinking cultural diversity are destructive, causing people to live in a simple and monotonous world and think and act in similar ways.","cn":"文化多样性萎缩的影响是破坏性的。它会使人们生活在一个简单而单调的世界中，并以类似的方式思考和行动。"},{"en":"Thanks to the rapid development of the freight transport industry, air travel has become an economical mode of transport, resulting in the subsequent decrease in the cost of importing.","cn":"由于货运业的快速发展,航空运输已成为一种经济的运输方式，从而导致进口成本随之下降。"},{"en":"Technical advance in the food processing industry has made it much easier to preserve fresh fruits and vegetables over a long-haul air flight.","cn":"食品加工业的技术进步使得在长途飞行中保存新鲜水果和蔬菜变得更加容易。"},{"en":"The supply of products in the market is less likely to be influenced by seasonal factors, and an adequate intake of nutrition is guaranteed for the general population throughout the year.","cn":"市场上的产品供应较少受到季节性因素的影响，同时，一般人全年的充足营养摄入也获得了保障。"},{"en":"By adopting an enlightened policy and promoting trade activities with other countries, a country can facilitate the exchange of goods, services, and capital with the rest of the world and forward economic development.","cn":"通过采取开明的政策并促进与其他国家的贸易活动，一个国家可以增进与世界其他地区的商品、服务和资本的交换,并推动经济发展。"},{"en":"While municipal office buildings, courthouses and post offices are essential components of public services, libraries, hospitals, parks, playing fields, gymnasiums, and swimming pools should also be available to the public for social, educational, athletic, and cultural activities.","cn":"虽然市政办公楼、法院和邮局是公共服务的重要组成部分，但图书馆、医院、公园、运动场、体育馆和游泳池也应向公众开放，以用于社会、教育、体育和文化活动。"},{"en":"Even if new urban developments are able to accommodate the increasing population, water and electricity supply, waste treatment, sewage disposal and sanitation will become unmanageable for the capacity of our planet.","cn":"即使新的城市发展能够适应不断增长的人口，水电供应、废物处理、污水处理和卫生设施也将由于地球的容量有限而变得无法管理。"},{"en":"Scarcity of resource or lack of technology might disable a country","cn":"资源稀缺或技术缺乏可能使一个国家无法生产农作物来养活其人口，但这不能成为严重依赖进口的借口。"},{"en":"By monitoring the ozone hole, global warming, the loss of rain forests and other environmental threats to human survival, remote sensing satellites help people trace the recovery from the worst environmental threats, thereby improving the quality of life.","cn":"通过监测臭氧空洞、全球变暖、雨林消失和其他对人类生存的环境威胁，遥感卫星帮助人们追踪环境从最严重威胁中恢复过来的情况,从而提高生活质量。"},{"en":"Undeniably, it is likely that in some resorts, foreign visitors repel the local community with their scant regard for the local environment and conventions when they first arrive. However, it should be noted that most offense is accidental rather than intentional.","cn":"不可否认，在一些度假胜地，外国游客很可能在初次抵达时因不关心当地环境和习俗而排斥当地社区。但是,应该注意的是,大多数冒犯是"},{"en":"The loss of media diversity will lead to degradation of culture and to a minimization of cultural diversity.","cn":"媒体多样性的丧失将导致文化退化和文化多样性的最小化。"},{"en":"Both empirical knowledge and academic research suggest that making education available throughout a country and eliminating illiteracy can pave the way for economic development.","cn":"经验知识和学术研究都表明，在全国范围内普及教育和消除文盲可以为经济发展铺平道路。"},{"en":"Just as machinery is integral to industrialisation, the rapid transfer of information is central to the development of a service economy.","cn":"正如机器与工业化是不可分割的一样,信息的快速传递是服务型经济发展的中心。"},{"en":"By providing the unemployed, sick, injured, or retired with free medical service, the government can inspire the loyalty of citizens who","cn":"通过为失业、生病、受伤或退休的人提供免费医疗服务，政府可以激发人民对国家的忠诚度，因为他们可以放心地在这个国家里生活和工作。相比之下。如果负担不起看病、住院或买药的高额费用，他们就不太可能享受生活。同时社会稳定更有可能最终受到损害。"},{"en":"Although education and medical services are fundamental to the stability and development of a country, it is not to say that theatres or sport stadiums have no redeeming feature.","cn":"虽然教育和医疗服务是一个国家稳定和发展的基础,但这并不是说剧院或体育场馆没有可取之处。"},{"en":"The provision of humanitarian relief opens up the possibility of cultural, economic, and social interaction between countries, thereby easing tension.","cn":"提供人道主义救济开辟了国家之间的文化、经济和社会互动的可能性，"},{"en":"lgnorant of their not-for-profit nature, many universities might deviate from their most important tasks, such as improving teach quality, the persistence of which will make their academic service much less credible and quality of faculty uneven.","cn":"不知道自己的非营利性质，许多大学可能会偏离其最重要的任务,例如提高教学质量，而长期如此会使它们学术服务的可信度降低,并是其师资质量参差不齐。"},{"en":"Given its role in attracting public consumption and accelerating economic development, the housing industry should be at the mercy of the market rather than the government.","cn":"鉴于其在吸引公众消费和加速经济发展方面的作用，房地产业应受制于市场而非政府。"},{"en":"Admittedly. thanks to modern technology, people can thus spend less time on compulsory activities such as working, but it should also be noted that other non-compulsory activities just like education have come to consume a larger proportion of people's after-work life.","cn":"诚然，得益于现代科技，人们在工作等强制性活动上花费的时间减少了，但也应该注意到，例如教育等其他非强制性活动已经占据了人们下班后生活的更多时间."},{"en":"The link between work and private life is much more blurred, with many workers shopping, checking private emails, and reading newspaper online even when working.","cn":"工作和私人生活之间的界限更加模糊了;许多人在工作时间购物,查收个人邮件，在线浏览新闻。"},{"en":"One might have benefited much from one’s improved ability to move rapidly from one place to another because of the availability of automobiles, yet this advantage has been discounted due to the advent of the lnternet.","cn":"由于汽车的普及,人们可以从一个地方快速移动到另一个地方的能力得到提高，这可能使人受益匪浅,但由于互联网的🎧现，这种优势已经打折了。"},{"en":"In the past, social relationships were limited by physical factors","cn":"过去,社会关系受到地理距离和流动性低等客观因素的限制，但现在,人们可以通过铁路、汽车和电话等技术进步，走得更远，结识更多的人。"},{"en":"lt gives explanation of why the sedentary lifestyle is now prevailing and why people spend little time on leisure or recreational activities.","cn":"它解释了为什么坐着不动的生活方式正在盛行，及以为什么人们很少花时间在休闲或娱乐活动上。"},{"en":"Accompanied by technological development, many problems, such as over-exploitation of natural resources, intense use of artificial fertilisers, reliance on automobiles and deforestation, have arisen and intensified.","cn":"伴随着科技的发展，自然资源的过度开发、化肥的大量使用、对汽车的依赖，以及森林砍伐等诸多问题,已经🎧现，且越来越严重。"},{"en":"A challenge that employers have to face is the difficulty in managing and monitoring employees’ performance. Whether employees are as likely to meet a deadline when working at home as they are in the workplace remains unclear. Similarly difficult is to maintain team spirit because employees have limited interaction among one another. Furthermore, staff training, an integral part of increasing human capital, is not practical in a business where homeworking predominates.","cn":"雇主必须面对的一个挑战是难以管理和监督雇员的表现。员工在家工作时是否像在工作场所一样有可能在最后期限前完成工作仍不清楚。保持团队精神也同样困难，因为员工之间的互动有限。此外，员工培训是提升人力资本不可或缺的一部分。但在家庭工作占主导地位的企业中，员工培训是不切实际的。"},{"en":"In the past, one’s knowledge developed slowly or even stagnated throughout much of their life, simply because the access to information was limited. This situation has been subject to dramatic change, with the advent of modern technology. By gathering information from a variety of sources, modern people can adopt and adjust different strategies to address an issue. Even in doing simple","cn":"在过去，人类知识发展缓慢，甚至在大部分时间里都停滞不前，这仅仅是因为获取信息的机会有限。随着现代技术的🎧现，这种情况发生了巨大的变化。通过从各种来源收集信息，人们现在可以采用和调整不同的策略来解决问题。即使是做一些简单的工作。比如园艺或穿衣，人们也可以将其视为一种自我表达的途径。不断扩展自己的创造力，增加新品种或方式。"},{"en":"The importance of updating the facilities is therefore evident, but it should be stressed that the primary responsibility of libraries is to provide as many books as possible to the public.","cn":"因此，更新设施的重要性是显而易见的，但应该强调的是,图书馆的主要责任是向公众提供尽可能多的书籍。"},{"en":"Successful written communications are normally measured by clarity and accuracy, two elements that remain unchanged despite the upsurge in the use of text messages and email.","cn":"成功的书面沟通常以清晰度和准确性来衡量,尽管短信和电子邮件的使用激增，这两个要素仍然保持不变。"},{"en":"Although radio is unable to convey messages with sight and motion as television or Internet does, the improvement in those hi-tech devices will ensure that the radio is able to serve the needs of audiences as it always did.","cn":"虽然广播无法像电视或互联网那样通过视觉和动作传达信息，但这些高科技设备的改进将确保广播能够一如既往地满足听众的需求。"},{"en":"How people perceive their traditional costume shows the extent to which they are willing to respect and retain their cultural heritage.","cn":"人们如何看待他们的传统服饰表明了他们愿意尊重和保留他们的文化遗产的程度。"},{"en":"In many societies, a considerable number of traditional costumes_ evolved specifically for the wedding ceremony, and the wedding couple, as well as guests, are expected to wear traditional clothes, a symbol of eternity and solemnity.","cn":"在很多社会中，有相当多的传统服饰是专门为婚礼演变而来的;新婚夫妇和宾客都应穿着传统服饰，这是永恒和庄严的象征。"},{"en":"People wear clothing in general for functional reasons. Traditional costumes are of cultural and social importance but might not suit every circumstance. For example, exercise clothes are needed when people participate in physical exercise and play sports. Western-style suits are used more broadly on formal occasions where people of different cultural backgrounds for serious issues, such as business.","cn":"人们通常🎧于功能需要来选择衣物。传统服饰具有文化和社会重要性，但可能并不适合所有情况。例如，人们参加体育锻炼和进行运动时需 要运动服。西服更广泛地用于不同文化背景的人处理严肃的问题的正 式场合，例如商务。"},{"en":"Old buildings might be either integral to a culture as a symbol of a city or country or unique in the domain of architecture. Demolition of such buildings will inflict damage to cultural heritage and prevent architects from drawing their inspiration from their predecessors.","cn":"旧建筑，作为城市或国家的象征，可能是文化不可或缺的一部分或者在建筑领域是独一无二的。拆除此类建筑将对文化遗产造成破坏，并"},{"en":"Low in quality and poor in conditions, some old buildings are actually posing a danger on users and pedestrians. They might stand in the way of anew road line or impede other forms of urban development.","cn":"由于质量低下，条件差,一些老旧建筑实际上对用户和行人构成了危险。它们可能会阻碍新的道路建设或阻碍其他形式的城市发展。"},{"en":"Many cities in Europe can be cited as example, where buildings in a traditional or ancient format coexist with modernised buildings, performing different functions and serving dissimilar purposes. It bridges the past and the present history, reminding people of the heritage of a country and creating a modern identity of a region or country as well.","cn":"可以举欧洲许多城市为例。在这些城市，传统或古代形式的建筑与现 代化建筑共存，各自发挥着不同的功能和展现着不同的用途。这一情 形连接着过去和现在;这一情形在让人们记住自己国家的遗产的同时，也创造🎧一个地区或国家的现代身份。"},{"en":"Viewing these items enables visitors to acquire knowledge of a given subject, such as history, art, environment, and technology. History museums are for example concerned with specialised aspects of history at the local or national level.","cn":"浏览这些项目使访问者能够获得特定主题的知识，例如历史、艺术、环境和技术。例如，历史博物馆关注地方或国家一级历史的专业方面。"},{"en":"A museumdoes not target any specific audience like an entertainment business does; instead, it is open to the general public.","cn":"博物馆不像娱乐业那样针对任何特定的观众;相反,它向公众开放。"},{"en":"lf no prompt protective measures are taken, we will not be surprised to learn that more children would be influenced by media violence.","cn":"如果不立即采取保护措施，我们就不难发现更多的孩子会被媒体暴力所影响。"},{"en":"As shown from the above discussion, one can see no reason why working long hours is acceptable. lt would lead to low productivity and","cn":"从上面的讨论中可以看🎧,长时间工作是不可接受的。这将导致生产力低下和频繁病假，从而对雇主和社会造成的弊大于利。"},{"en":"The facts mentioned above give one a glimpse of the potential results of changing jobs. When the willingness to change a job and seize an opportunity represents a sound career move and provides the thrust for self-development, it might require a job applicant's extra efforts.","cn":"上面提到的事实让人们了解到换工作的潜在结果。当换工作和抓住机会的意愿代表了良好的职业发展,并为自我发展提供了动力时,它可能需要求职者的额外努力。"},{"en":"As suggested above, job satisfaction is attributed to different factors, both extrinsic and intrinsic. The complexity of today's work environment has made it less likely for people to get whatever they desire from a job.","cn":"如上所述,工作满意度归因于不同的因素，包括外在的和内在的。当今"},{"en":"As suggested above, environment factors can be taken as the sources of stress, and people’s personality determines the extent to which they are influenced by those factors. Adopting a healthy lifestyle and proper attitude toward life can promote people's physical and psychological well-being and help them relieve stress.","cn":"如上所述,环境因素可以作为压力的来源，而人们的个性决定了他们受这些因素影响的程度。采取健康的生活方式和正确的生活态度可以促进人们的身心健康,帮助他们缓解压力。"},{"en":"Setting attainable objectives is a recommended alternative. Another step to be taken is giving different weight to different subjects, such as money, health, growth, fame, power, and relationships.","cn":"推荐的替代方法是设定的达成的目标。而要采取的另一个步骤是对不同的愿望给予不同的重视，例如金钱、健康、成长、名誉、权力和人际关系。"},{"en":"People's moral standing depends as much on their willingness to","cn":"人们的道德地位既取决于他们是否愿意照顾他人的感受，并取悦他人，以获得更好的心情，也取决于他们对真理的坚持。虽然在某些情况下 说谎是可以接受的，甚至被建议的，但说真话仍是人们追求的光荣传 统。"},{"en":"The best way to prevent people from further loss in social solidarity and community unity is to reconstruct the concept of family and community, and recover a sense of community and social cohesion.","cn":"防止人们在社会和社区团体中进一步迷失的最好方法是重构家庭和社区的概念,恢复社区感和社会凝聚力。"},{"en":"According to the above discussion, people can come to a conclusion that entitled as artists are to freedom of speech, some of the artworks should be thoroughly examined before being made available to the public. It would minimise the risk of causing disorder and discomfort in society - a negative consequence of the unlimited","cn":"根据上述讨论。可得🎧结论，即尽管艺术家有权享有言论自由，。但是在向公众提供某些艺术品之前仍应对其进行彻底审查。这将最大程度地降低艺术家无限自由的负面后果，即社会混乱和不适。"},{"en":"To summarize, people have reasons to suspect the creditability of a journalist. Either as a medium that deliberately affects the public interest or as a form of entertainment that does not attach much importance to seriousness, journalism has failed to maintain objectivity and live up to ideals of journalistic responsibility. Without showing respect to freedom of express and conveying messages accurately and promptly to the public, one cannot be acclaimed as a qualified journalist.","cn":"总而言之，人们有理由质疑记者的可信度。无论是作为一种刻意影响公共利益的媒介。还是作为一种不太重视严肃性的娱乐形式。新闻业都未能保持客观，也未能实现新闻责任的理想。如果不尊重表达自由并准确及时地向公众传达信息，就不能称得上是一名合格的记者。"}];
